This file makes RIX run in portable mode.

When portable.marker sits beside RIX.exe, RIX stores its settings, logs,
WebView profile and Psiphon identity in the data\ folder next to the
executable instead of %APPDATA%\RIX. Move or delete the whole folder as one
unit; nothing is installed and no uninstaller is needed.

Remove this file only if you want this copy to share the installed app's
settings in %APPDATA%\RIX.
